{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Numonic API","version":"1.0.0","description":"Numonic is an AI-native digital asset management platform. This API lets you store, search, organize, and automate operations on creative assets (images, video, audio, 3D models) with full provenance tracking, metadata preservation, and compliance-ready publishing.\n\n**Getting started:** Authenticate with a [Numonic API key](https://numonic.ai/docs/api#authentication) (`napi_` prefix). All endpoints are tenant-scoped — pass `X-Tenant-ID` if your key has access to multiple tenants.\n\n**Related:** [MCP Tool Reference](https://numonic.ai/docs/api/mcp) · [Search Syntax](https://numonic.ai/docs/search) · [Glossary](https://numonic.ai/glossary)","contact":{"name":"Numonic Labs","url":"https://numonic.ai"},"license":{"name":"Proprietary"}},"servers":[{"url":"https://numonic.ai","description":"Production"}],"security":[{"NumonicApiKey":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"Assets","description":"An **asset** is any media file (image, video, audio, 3D model) stored in Numonic, identified by a content-addressed SHA-1 hash. Assets are ingested via a three-phase upload flow: request a signed URL, upload directly to storage, then confirm to trigger metadata extraction, thumbnail generation, and embedding indexing. Search assets using [hybrid search](/docs/search) that combines structured filters (`tool:comfyui`, `mime_type:image/png`) with semantic similarity. [Learn more about AI-native asset management →](https://numonic.ai/glossary/ai-native-dam)"},{"name":"Collections","description":"A **collection** is a curated, hierarchical grouping of assets — think of collections as folders and [tags](/glossary/ai-metadata) as labels. Collections support nesting up to 5 levels deep, ordered asset membership with positional roles (e.g., KeyVisual, SupportingElement), and publishing as public galleries. Unlike tags (flat, unordered, many-to-many), collections carry structure and sequencing. Assets can be both tagged and collected simultaneously. [Learn more about collections →](https://numonic.ai/guides/ai-native-dam-architecture)"},{"name":"Annotations","description":"Rich-text notes attached to workflow nodes for documentation, review, and collaboration. Annotations support Markdown formatting and maintain a full audit trail of edits. Use annotations to document why a ComfyUI node was configured a certain way, flag quality issues, or coordinate with team members. [Learn more about annotations →](https://numonic.ai/docs/notes)"},{"name":"Publishing","description":"Publish collections as shareable public galleries with privacy-aware metadata handling. Each publication uses a **disclosure preset** that controls what metadata is exposed: `share` (full metadata for collaboration), `portfolio` (creative metadata only), `client` (minimal, delivery-safe), or `archive` (original file preserved as-is). Published galleries receive stable public URLs suitable for embedding in portfolios, client reviews, or external websites. [Learn more about AI content compliance →](https://numonic.ai/guides/ai-content-compliance)"},{"name":"Export","description":"Download assets with format conversion and privacy-aware metadata stripping. Export applies the same disclosure presets as Publishing — choose how much metadata to include based on the recipient. Supports asynchronous export for large batches."},{"name":"Webhooks","description":"Subscribe to Numonic events (asset created, collection published, pipeline completed, etc.) via HTTP callbacks. Each webhook receives an HMAC-SHA256 signature header for payload verification. Use webhooks to integrate Numonic into CI/CD pipelines, Slack notifications, or downstream processing systems."},{"name":"Health","description":"Operational health checks for monitoring API availability, database connectivity, storage access, and external service status. Use these endpoints for uptime monitoring and integration health dashboards."},{"name":"Storage","description":"Manage tenant storage quotas and generate pre-signed URLs for direct file upload and download. Signed URLs allow clients to transfer files directly to/from object storage without proxying through the API server, reducing latency and bandwidth costs."},{"name":"Public Galleries","description":"Publicly accessible endpoints for viewing published galleries and their assets — no authentication required. These endpoints power embeddable portfolio pages, client review links, and public showcases. Only collections explicitly published via the Publishing endpoints appear here."},{"name":"Workflows","description":"Store and track **workflow execution graphs** from tools like ComfyUI and n8n. A workflow *definition* is the reusable template (the ComfyUI JSON graph), while an *execution* is a specific run with its inputs, outputs, and per-node state. Numonic extracts and indexes workflow metadata from uploaded assets automatically — use these endpoints to query, annotate, and manage stored workflows. [Learn more about ComfyUI workflows →](https://numonic.ai/guides/comfyui-asset-management)"},{"name":"Pipelines","description":"Composable **automation chains** for batch asset operations. A pipeline is a linear sequence of typed stages: `select` (choose assets) → `filter` (narrow results) → `transform`/`action` (modify or act) → `output`/`summarize` (deliver results). Pipelines can be saved, templatized, and promoted to automation rules. Use `dry_run: true` to preview what a pipeline would do without making changes. Destructive actions (delete, archive) require explicit `confirm: true`. Pipelines are distinct from Workflows — a Pipeline is a Numonic automation chain, while a Workflow is a stored ComfyUI/n8n execution graph."},{"name":"Automation Rules","description":"Event-driven triggers that automatically execute pipelines when conditions are met. Rules can fire on events (asset ingested, collection updated), on a schedule (cron), or on a watch interval. Attach rules to saved pipelines to create fully automated workflows — e.g., \"when a new image is uploaded, auto-tag it and add to the Review collection.\""},{"name":"Prompts","description":"A **prompt** is a versioned text artifact stored in the Prompt Library, identified by a content-addressed SHA-1 hash. Prompts are backfilled from Midjourney metadata or created manually, with full version history, evaluation scores, parameter extraction, and asset provenance links. Search prompts using [grammar syntax](/docs/search) (`model:midjourney`, `category:landscape`, `ar:16:9`) or free-text queries. Each prompt tracks its generation parameters, linked assets, and quality evaluations across four dimensions (quality, relevance, creativity, coherence). [Learn more about the Prompt Library](https://numonic.ai/features/prompt-library)"},{"name":"Models","description":"An AI **model** (LoRA, checkpoint, UNet, etc.) tracked in the Model Library. Each model is identified by a content-addressed SHA-1 hash and linked to the assets it helped generate. Models carry metadata (display name, description, trigger words, recommended weight, base model), version history with training details, and usage counts. Use the Model Library to browse which models produced your assets, compare versions, and curate model metadata for team discovery."},{"name":"Sessions","description":"A **creative session** is a time-bounded group of assets produced during a continuous creative workflow. Sessions are computed dynamically by clustering assets whose creation timestamps fall within a configurable time window (default: 2 hours) and were produced by the same tool. Sessions surface the natural rhythm of creative work, making it easy to review, compare, and organise outputs from a single sitting."},{"name":"Production Review","description":"Submit an asset for review against a work item or project, collect threaded comments, and record `needs_changes` / `approved` decisions. Decisions are append-only events: a submission's `state` is its latest decision, and a resubmission is a new submission that `supersedes` the previous one with the next version number. References cross the wire as `\"{backend}:{id}\"` (e.g. `native:<hash>`). Every write requires an `Idempotency-Key` header."}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"NumonicApiKey":{"type":"apiKey","in":"header","name":"x-api-key","description":"Numonic API key (prefixed `napi_`). Generate keys at Settings → API Keys in the Numonic dashboard."}},"schemas":{"GrammarField":{"type":"object","properties":{"field":{"type":"string","description":"Field name used in grammar queries","example":"tool"},"description":{"type":"string","description":"What this field matches against","example":"AI tool that generated the asset (e.g., midjourney, stable-diffusion)"},"example":{"type":"string","description":"Example grammar expression using this field","example":"tool:midjourney"}},"required":["field","description","example"]},"SearchGrammarReference":{"type":"object","properties":{"operators":{"type":"object","properties":{"AND":{"type":"string","example":"tool:midjourney AND tag:approved"},"OR":{"type":"string","example":"tool:midjourney OR tool:dall-e"},"NOT":{"type":"string","example":"tool:midjourney NOT status:Trashed"},"include":{"type":"string","description":"Prefix + requires term","example":"+tag:hero"},"exclude":{"type":"string","description":"Prefix - excludes term","example":"-status:Trashed"},"grouping":{"type":"string","description":"Parentheses for precedence","example":"(tool:midjourney OR tool:dall-e) AND tag:approved"}},"required":["AND","OR","NOT","include","exclude","grouping"],"description":"Boolean operators for combining grammar expressions"},"value_syntax":{"type":"object","properties":{"exact":{"type":"string","description":"Quoted string for exact match","example":"title:\"hero banner\""},"wildcard":{"type":"string","description":"Asterisk for prefix/suffix matching","example":"filename:hero*"},"range_gt":{"type":"string","description":"Greater-than for numeric/date fields","example":"width:>1920"},"range_lt":{"type":"string","description":"Less-than for numeric/date fields","example":"height:<1080"},"range_between":{"type":"string","description":"Double-dot for range queries","example":"created:2025-01-01..2025-12-31"}},"required":["exact","wildcard","range_gt","range_lt","range_between"],"description":"Value syntax for field expressions"},"fields":{"type":"object","properties":{"core":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GrammarField"},"description":"Core metadata fields"},"dates":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GrammarField"},"description":"Date/time fields (support range syntax)"},"dimensions":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GrammarField"},"description":"Image dimension fields (support range syntax)"},"ai_generation":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GrammarField"},"description":"AI tool and generation metadata fields"},"comfyui":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GrammarField"},"description":"ComfyUI workflow-specific fields"},"png_metadata":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GrammarField"},"description":"PNG text chunk fields"},"lineage":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GrammarField"},"description":"Evolution and lineage tracking fields"}},"required":["core","dates","dimensions","ai_generation","comfyui","png_metadata","lineage"],"description":"Available grammar fields grouped by domain"},"search_modes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"mode":{"type":"string"},"description":{"type":"string"},"example":{"type":"string"}},"required":["mode","description","example"]},"description":"Available search modes that can be specified in the request"}},"required":["operators","value_syntax","fields","search_modes"]},"CollectionTreeItem":{"type":"object","properties":{"collection_h":{"type":"string","description":"SHA-1 hash identifying this collection"},"collection_path":{"type":"string","description":"Dot-separated path in collection hierarchy","example":"projects.nike"},"collection_name":{"type":"string","description":"Name of this collection (last path segment)"},"display_name":{"type":["string","null"]},"description":{"type":["string","null"]},"icon":{"type":["string","null"]},"color":{"type":["string","null"]},"asset_count":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of assets in this collection"},"depth":{"type":"integer","description":"Depth in the collection tree (0 = root)"},"parent_collection_h":{"type":["string","null"]},"updated_at":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 8601 timestamp of the most recent activity on this collection: creation, a rename/description/icon/colour edit, a move, or an asset being added, removed or reordered (#2067)"}},"required":["collection_h","collection_path","collection_name","display_name","description","icon","color","asset_count","depth","parent_collection_h","updated_at"]},"CollectionListResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"collections":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CollectionTreeItem"}},"total":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["collections","total","limit","offset"]},"ErrorResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"error":{"type":"string","description":"Human-readable error message","example":"Asset not found"},"details":{"description":"Additional error details — may contain validation errors or diagnostic info"}},"required":["error"]},"SuccessMessage":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"type":"string","description":"Human-readable success message","example":"Operation completed successfully"}},"required":["message"]},"CreateCollectionRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":255,"pattern":"^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\-\\s]+$"},"parentPath":{"type":["string","null"],"pattern":"^[a-z0-9_]+(\\.[a-z0-9_]+)*$","default":null},"displayName":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},"icon":{"type":"string","maxLength":50},"color":{"type":"string","pattern":"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"}},"required":["name"],"description":"Request body for creating a new collection"},"CollectionDetailsResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"collection_h":{"type":"string"},"collection_name":{"type":"string"},"display_name":{"type":["string","null"]},"description":{"type":["string","null"]},"icon":{"type":["string","null"]},"color":{"type":["string","null"]},"collection_path":{"type":"string"},"depth":{"type":"integer"},"parent_collection_h":{"type":["string","null"]},"created_at":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 8601 creation timestamp"},"asset_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["collection_h","collection_name","display_name","description","icon","color","collection_path","depth","parent_collection_h","created_at","asset_count"]},"UpdateCollectionRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"displayName":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},"icon":{"type":"string","maxLength":50},"color":{"type":"string","pattern":"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"},"parentId":{"type":["string","null"],"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{40}$"}},"description":"Request body for updating collection details, or reparenting via `parentId`"},"CollectionAssetItem":{"type":"object","properties":{"asset_h":{"type":"string"},"position":{"type":["number","null"]},"role":{"type":["string","null"]},"added_at":{"type":"string"},"filename":{"type":["string","null"]},"title":{"type":["string","null"]},"mime_type":{"type":["string","null"]},"thumbnail_url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Pre-signed thumbnail URL (~10 min expiry)"},"download_url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Pre-signed download URL (~1 hr expiry)"}},"required":["asset_h","position","role","added_at","filename","title","mime_type","thumbnail_url","download_url"]},"CollectionAssetsResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CollectionAssetItem"}},"total":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["data","total","limit","offset","hasMore"]},"AddAssetToCollectionRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"assetH":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{40}$"},"position":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"role":{"type":"string","maxLength":50}},"required":["assetH"],"description":"Request body for adding an asset to a collection"},"ReorderAssetsRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"positions":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"asset_h":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{40}$"},"position":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}},"required":["asset_h","position"]}}},"required":["positions"],"description":"Request body for reordering assets within a collection"},"PrivacyPreset":{"type":"string","enum":["share","portfolio","client","archive"],"default":"portfolio","description":"Privacy preset controlling which metadata is included when publishing or exporting: share (full), portfolio (creative only), client (minimal), archive (original preserved)"},"CollectionVisibility":{"type":"string","enum":["public","unlisted","private"],"default":"public","description":"Reachability/listing tier for a published collection (ORTHOGONAL to privacyPreset): public (listed + slug + hash), unlisted (hash-only, never listed), private (not publicly reachable)"},"PublishPreset":{"type":"string","enum":["web-standard","high-quality","thumbnail"],"default":"web-standard","description":"Image optimization preset applied during collection publish"},"PublishCollectionRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"privacyPreset":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PrivacyPreset"},"visibility":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CollectionVisibility"},"publishPreset":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PublishPreset"}},"description":"Request body for publishing a collection with privacy preset, visibility tier, and optimization preset"},"CreateAnnotationRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"workflow_node_id":{"type":"string","description":"Workflow node ID (hash key) to annotate"},"content":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":10000,"description":"Annotation text content"},"content_type":{"type":"string","enum":["text","markdown","json"],"default":"text","description":"Content format type"},"visibility":{"type":"string","enum":["private","team","public"],"default":"team","description":"Visibility level: private (author only), team (tenant), public (all)"}},"required":["workflow_node_id","content"]},"AnnotationItem":{"type":"object","properties":{"annotation_id":{"type":"string"},"annotation_link":{"type":"string"},"workflow_node_id":{"type":"string"},"content":{"type":"string"},"content_type":{"type":"string","enum":["text","markdown","json"]},"visibility":{"type":"string","enum":["private","team","public"]},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["active","resolved","deleted"]},"created_at":{"type":"string"},"superseded_at":{"type":["string","null"]},"superseded_by":{"type":["string","null"]},"author":{"type":"object","properties":{"agent_id":{"type":"string"},"display_name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["agent_id","display_name"]}},"required":["annotation_id","annotation_link","workflow_node_id","content","content_type","visibility","status","created_at","author"]},"AnnotationsListResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"annotations":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AnnotationItem"}},"total_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["annotations","total_count"]},"UpdateAnnotationRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"content":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":10000,"description":"Updated annotation text"},"visibility":{"type":"string","enum":["private","team","public"],"description":"Updated visibility level (optional - defaults to current)"}},"required":["content"]},"AssetCreatedResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"assetH":{"type":"string","description":"Hash of the newly created asset","example":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4"},"interactionH":{"type":"string","description":"Hash of the creation interaction (provenance record)"},"extractedMetadata":{"description":"Metadata extracted from the uploaded file (tool-specific)"}},"required":["assetH","interactionH"]},"CreateAssetRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"storagePath":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"filename":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":255},"mimeType":{"type":"string","pattern":"^\\w+\\/[-.\\w]+(?:\\+[-.\\w]+)?$"},"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":{"type":"string","maxLength":5000},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"maxItems":50},"collectionH":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{40}$"},"folderId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"uploadOrigin":{"type":"string","enum":["human_initiated","agent_generated"]},"uploadRoute":{"type":"string","enum":["node","watcher","browser-import"]},"sourceFileLastModified":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},"required":["storagePath","filename","mimeType"]},"SignedUrlResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"signedUrl":{"type":"string","description":"Pre-signed URL for direct upload/download to storage"},"path":{"type":"string","description":"Storage path for the file"},"token":{"type":"string","description":"Upload token (for upload URLs)"}},"required":["signedUrl"]},"ExportPreset":{"type":"string","enum":["share","portfolio","client","archive","custom"]},"CustomExportOptions":{"type":"object","properties":{"stripWorkflow":{"type":"boolean","default":true},"stripPrompt":{"type":"boolean","default":true},"stripModels":{"type":"boolean","default":true},"stripSeeds":{"type":"boolean","default":true},"stripGPS":{"type":"boolean","default":true},"stripPersonal":{"type":"boolean","default":false},"stripA1111Parameters":{"type":"boolean","default":true}}},"ExportFormat":{"type":"string","enum":["png","jpeg","webp","preserve"],"default":"preserve"},"IptcAiOptions":{"type":"object","properties":{"addIptcAi":{"type":"boolean","default":true}},"default":{"addIptcAi":true}},"ExportOptions":{"type":"object","properties":{"preset":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ExportPreset"},"customOptions":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CustomExportOptions"},"format":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ExportFormat"},"iptcOptions":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/IptcAiOptions"}},"required":["preset"]},"SingleExportRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"assetH":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{40}$"},"options":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ExportOptions"}},"required":["assetH","options"]},"WebhookCreatedResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string","format":"uri"},"events":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"secret":{"type":"string","description":"HMAC-SHA256 signing secret — shown only once. Store securely.","example":"whsec_a1b2c3d4e5f6..."},"created_at":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","name","url","events","enabled","secret","created_at"]},"CreateWebhookRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":255,"description":"Human-friendly name for this webhook subscription","example":"My Webhook"},"description":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"description":"Optional description of this webhook subscription","example":"Notifies Slack when assets are uploaded"},"url":{"type":"string","format":"uri","description":"Destination URL that will receive webhook POST requests","example":"https://example.com/webhook"},"events":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z]+\\.[a-z_.]+$"},"minItems":1,"maxItems":50,"description":"List of event names to subscribe to (e.g. \"asset.created\")","example":["asset.created","asset.updated"]},"enabled":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Whether this webhook subscription is active","example":true},"timeout_ms":{"type":"integer","minimum":1000,"maximum":60000,"default":10000,"description":"Timeout for each webhook delivery attempt in milliseconds","example":10000},"custom_headers":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"string"},"description":"Optional custom HTTP headers sent with each webhook request","example":{"X-Custom-Header":"value"}}},"required":["name","url","events"],"description":"Request body for creating a new webhook subscription"},"WebhookResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Webhook hash (SHA-1)"},"name":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string","format":"uri"},"events":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"timeout_ms":{"type":"integer"},"created_at":{"type":"string"},"updated_at":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","name","url","events","enabled","timeout_ms","created_at","updated_at"]},"HealthCheckResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["healthy","unhealthy"],"description":"Overall health status","example":"healthy"},"timestamp":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 8601 timestamp of the check"}},"required":["status"]},"AssetDetailsResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"asset_h":{"type":"string","description":"Content-addressed SHA-1 hash identifying this asset","example":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4"},"title":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Human-friendly title (auto-generated or user-set)"},"filename":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Original filename at upload time","example":"hero-banner.png"},"mime_type":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"MIME type of the stored file","example":"image/png"},"status":{"type":["string","null"],"enum":["PendingUpload","PendingProcessing","Active","Trashed","Archived"],"description":"Current asset lifecycle status"},"created_at":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"ISO 8601 creation timestamp"},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"User-assigned tags for categorization","example":["hero","campaign-spring"]},"storage":{"type":"object","properties":{"size_bytes":{"type":["number","null"],"description":"File size in bytes","example":2048576}},"required":["size_bytes"],"description":"Storage metadata"},"visual_details":{"type":"object","properties":{"width":{"type":["number","null"]},"height":{"type":["number","null"]}},"required":["width","height"],"description":"Image/video dimensions in pixels"},"collections":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"collection_h":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":["string","null"]}},"required":["collection_h","name"]},"description":"Collections this asset belongs to"},"download_url":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Pre-signed download URL (only present when include_download_url=true)"}},"required":["asset_h","title","filename","mime_type","status","created_at","tags","storage","collections"]},"AssetUpdatedResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"message":{"type":"string"},"updates_applied":{"type":"object","properties":{"common_details":{"type":"boolean"},"status":{"type":"boolean"},"tags":{"type":"boolean"}},"description":"Which update operations were applied"}},"required":["message","updates_applied"]},"UpdateAssetRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":{"type":"string","maxLength":5000},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["Draft","PendingApproval","Approved","Rejected","Archived"]},"tags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"maxItems":500}}},"C2PAStatusResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"asset_h":{"type":"string"},"scanned":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether C2PA scanning has been performed"},"c2pa":{"type":"object","properties":{"has_c2pa_manifest":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"detection_method":{"type":["string","null"]},"detection_confidence":{"type":["number","null"]},"detected_at":{"type":["string","null"]},"